{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light Up The Town</strong> is a cozy, creative game about spreading  cheer in a wintery town.\u00a0Play as <strong>Bean</strong>, a young ferret tasked with putting up lights and  decorations around Bellflower, Colorado in time for the Winter Festival.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click anywhere to throw string lights and Christmas/holiday decorations, and light up 18+ handcrafted levels. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate any way you want to, customizing size and rotation of decorations.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins around town to unlock even more lights and decorations.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bellflower's annual Winter Festival is coming up, but the town is still dark! Local electrician Chuck is out of commission, so it's up to his precocious daughter <strong>Bean</strong> to put up lights and decorations around town before the festival.  And with a blizzard on the way, the holidays hang in the balance.\u00a0What does it take to make your community a better place?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3419910?t=1772749140","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/266d64f5027dff2a07dc1f219a821654007f9222/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772749140","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/7afe6f94308c2630d55032e35454d0e5b7da5119/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772749140","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419910/7afe6f94308c2630d55032e35454d0e5b7da5119/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772749140","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descript